02 0 R/Next 7899 0 R/Parent 7872 0 R/Prev 7903 0 R/Title(B. During the 30 days Turf Establishment Period, the Contractor must:)>>endobj7902 0 obj<</D[3213 0 R/XYZ 88 182 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj7903 0 obj<</A 7904 0 R/Next 7901 0 R/Parent 7872 0 R/Prev 7905 0 R/Title(A. The Establishment Period for turf shall begin immediately after complete sodding of a section\(s\) with the approval of the COR or designee, and continue for a minimum of 30 days, at which time the Government will perform the final turf inspectionŽ ..\.)>>endobj7904 0 obj<</D[3213 0 R/XYZ 88 265 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj7905 0 obj<</A 7906 0 R/Next 7903 0 R/Parent 7872 0 R/Prev 7907 0 R/Title(B. Maintain mulch in a uniform depth.  Hand weed and/or use appropriate chemical controls for weed control in mulch beds until Final Acceptance.)>>endobj7906 0 obj<</D[3213 0 R/XYZ 88 334 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj7907 0 obj<</A 7908 0 R/Next 7905 0 R/Parent 7872 0 R/Prev 7909 0 R/Title(A. Cut and remove sod in a circle around the trunks of existing trees.  Provide a 3-inch deep layer mulch material to tree mulch rings, and other areas surrounding groves of trees where lack of sunlight and/or preponderance of tree roots preclude the ...)>>endobj7908 0 obj<</D[3213 0 R/XYZ 88 416 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj7909 0 obj<</A 7910 0 R/Next 7907 0 R/Parent 7872 0 R/Prev 7911 0 R/Title(A. Requests to irrigate newly placed sod, to include amount and frequency, must be made to and approved by the COR/Cemetery Director, or their designee.  Access to and programming of the irrigation remote control valves will be performed by cemetery p...)>>endobj7910 0 obj<</D[3213 0 R/XYZ 88 554 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj7911 0 obj<</A 7912 0 R/Next 7909 0 R/Parent 7872 0 R/Prev 7913 0 R/Title(K. The contractor must warranty the sod for one \(1\) year after the date of Final Acceptance of the project.)>>endobj7912 0 obj<</D[3213 0 R/XYZ 88 623 0.0]/S/GoTo>>endobj7913 0 obj<</A 7914 0 R/Next 7911 0 R/Parent 7872 0 R/Prev 7915 0 R/Tit